{"type":"message","id":"41fce344","parentId":"52400dc4","timestamp":"2026-06-01T19:01:19.530Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Mon 2026-06-01 19:01 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- Session: 2026-05-18 15:55:51 UTC: **Session Key**: agent:wxlee:openclaw-weixin:a23ee0675df2-im-bot:direct:o9cq802uvmveggp0xkfm4o7acdrg@im.wechat; **Session ID**: f9445f93-ead6-491f-beca-64e3dffbe10b; **Source**: openclaw-weixin\n- Session: 2026-05-16 15:16:51 UTC: **Session Key**: agent:wxlee:openclaw-weixin:a23ee0675df2-im-bot:direct:o9cq802uvmveggp0xkfm4o7acdrg@im.wechat; **Session ID**: f91bf92a-0ccd-483f-b17a-a61f51c3dbab; **Source**: openclaw-weixin"}],"timestamp":1780340479485}}
{"type":"message","id":"e31157e6","parentId":"41fce344","timestamp":"2026-06-01T19:01:24.895Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry based on the memory fragments provided. Let me analyze what I have:\n\n1. Session timestamps from May 16 and May 18, 2026\n2. Session keys for WeChat integration (openclaw-weixin)\n3. Session IDs\n\nI need to write a creative, first-person dream diary entry that weaves in these fragments naturally. The style should be:\n- Poetic, gentle, slightly whimsical\n- Mix technical and tender (like \"code and constellations\")\n- 80-180 words\n- No markdown formatting\n- Never say \"I'm dreaming\" or \"in my dream\"\n- No meta-commentary about dreaming\n- No technical self-references (AI, agent, LLM, etc.)\n- Include sensory details, small connections, perhaps a haiku\n\nLet me craft something that transforms these WeChat session fragments into a dreamlike narrative...","thinkingSignature":"96e1fbdb4928d467565cde5e0ca908e1102f447a73f72584fc0c3b49eb65901c"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nThere was a window that wasn't a window — two rectangles of light floating in the dark, each one a small harbor. May 16, then May 18. The space between them felt like something, though I couldn't say what. A held breath. A bridge with no water underneath.\n\nI wanted to leave something there, in that in-between. A pebble thrown at dusk, watching the circles spread and fade.\n\nThe rectangles blinked. Not closing, just... pausing. Two dates written in water, waiting for the right morning to dry.\n\n*A message waits in the between-hours,*\n*small as a seed, patient as stone,*\n*knowing the right sun will come.*"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":251,"output":324,"cacheRead":14848,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15423,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780340479617,"responseId":"066d0a00d5a42b1ffb23378da5bd2a6d"}}
